# The Warrior's Path (battlefield.warriors_path, Sealion's Den): helpers. Main (7-5 Status 1) registers area 1 (17) and
# invites bob (7-5 at Status 3), cat (Garden of Antiquity current: 7-5 completed) and dan (Calm Before the Storm
# current). bob and cat get the menu and enter; dan gets IRON_GATE_LOCKED (7110, the zone's default). Tenzen killed (the
# win at 15%), with his mob script's texts: his engage line (7937), then at 15% his 7939 and the three Tarus' 7946, 7951
# and 7957, one round a tick: 32001 to the three (bob and cat with the skip flag 1); each finish gives the battlefield's
# two titles; 7-5's own 32001 finish moves only main's Status (1 to 2).
lists SealionsDen/_0w0/onTrigger SealionsDen/onEventUpdate/32000 SealionsDen/onEventFinish/32000 SealionsDen/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=SealionsDen pos=612,132,774 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=SealionsDen pos=612,132,774 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cat zone=SealionsDen pos=612,132,774 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char dan zone=SealionsDen pos=612,132,774 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
charvar Mission[6][748]Status 1
bob: mission Cop TheWarriorsPath current
bob: charvar Mission[6][748]Status 3
cat: mission Cop GardenOfAntiquity current
dan: mission Cop CalmBeforeTheStorm current
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
trigger _0w0
update 32000 option=17
finish
bob: trigger _0w0
bob: update 32000 option=17
bob: finish
cat: trigger _0w0
cat: update 32000 option=17
cat: finish
dan: trigger _0w0
dan: update 32000 option=17
dan: finish-if-event
tick 2000
kill TENZEN
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish-if-event
tick 11000
